## What We Are Building

Three threads, all toward the North-Star «фабрика самодвижется» (self-moving factory; вести≠чинить):

1. **Episode Autonomy Scorecard** — the factory now measures itself per episode. KPI-1 = agent-runs/shot (E16 ~11, self-moving ~1-2). KPI-2 = code-able intelligent touches = manual_trigger + mechanical-gate approvals, split **human (Director time) vs AI-EP (Opus tokens)** — BOTH are cost to reduce by transferring muscle to code. Autonomy% = chain_fired/total. Creative-gate approvals = floor (not waste). SSOT = `episode_scorecard` DB table (append-only, 3 phases snapshot→published→analytics); `.md` render = `REV-scorecard` asset row. Auto-generates on EXEC-STITCH done + publish.

2. **Two regression fixes** (pre-smoke hardening for E16 defects the Director flagged):
   - fanout machine-gun: `fanoutShots` re-fired the designer 3-7×/shot.
   - video-revision drop: Director's REVISION notes on video plans were silently dropped.

3. **Responsibility Matrix (design only, step B, NOT built)** — the big idea: matrices ARE governance modes (Mode X = a saved preset matrix). Per-gate {owner: auto|ai-ep|director, retry_N, on_limit: halt|pass|stop}. Fills: series-default → per-episode override → on-the-fly edit. Replaces the 5-mode enum (subtraction). Hard-limits pinned. It's the fix for the EREF defect (gate-by-construction).

