## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Scorecard deriver + persist + render + auto-hook** — confirmed: `tsc 0`, `1145/1145` vitest, `replay-pilot 30/30`. E16 live: KPI-1 11.31 (362 runs/32 shots), KPI-2 194, autonomy 53.9% — cross-checks the manual night analysis. Row + `.md` asset written to DB.
- **Backfill E01-E16** — confirmed: 18 episodes, 0 skipped. Trend visible (E11 peak pain 357 touches, E16 194). NOT monotonically improving.
- **Pagination bug caught + fixed** — confirmed: E16 KPI-2 read 180/172 (unstable) → 194 (stable both runs) after paging past PostgREST's 1000-row cap.
- **fanout fix** (`c19955b`) — `tsc 0`, `1145/1145`. Idempotency now keys on the PLAN (SPC-ref_plan/SPC-shot_plan), not the downstream image/video.
- **revision fix** (`996e31d`) — `tsc 0`, `1145/1145`, `replay 30/30`. SPC-shot_plan/REV-shot_plan revision now routes to exec-vanim/plan with the note.
- **Merge state** — confirmed: `HEAD == origin/master == 996e31d`. Both deltas empty. Neighbor already merged my 3 commits + their own (d82df7d, 3c37e96) onto master, linear, clean. NOTHING to merge.

