## What Did NOT Work (and why) — root-cause findings

- **EREF churn is NOT a critic revision loop** — data: EPREV verdicts 20 PASS/1 REVISE, CREAD 46/2. Critics innocent. Re-fires were manual re-dispatch.
- **EREF churn root cause = `fanoutShots` idempotency bug** (`5cfc64d`, 2026-07-04 23:04, the regression): the tool skipped shots that had the final IMG output, but image gen lags ~9min, so any re-call during that window re-fired the designer for every not-yet-imaged shot. Polina's auto-react re-called it ~hourly → E16 114 ref_plan versions/32 shots (v7 on some) vs E15 27/24. 118 designer manual triggers (103 AI-EP). FIXED in c19955b.
- **Video-revision drop root cause** — `revisionEventForAsset` returns null for SPC-shot_plan/VID-shot, and the ref-revision block excluded them → dead-end. animator.ts ALREADY injects revisionNote (lines 990-996) but was never fired. PROVEN by data: E16 SPC-shot_plan SH08 kebab revoke (07-06 00:46) → 0 EXEC-VANIM re-runs. FIXED in 996e31d.
- **«No-critic» bypass** (Director's #4, still OPEN as design) — critic is NOT enforced by construction. 4 paths reach the executor; critic gates only one. Manual /trigger of EXEC-EREF/EXEC-VGEN bypasses the critic entirely. Matrix (gate-by-construction) is the fix — NOT yet built.

