## Decisions Made

- **KPI-2 counts human AND AI-EP touches** — both are cost (Director time / Opus tokens); goal = transfer muscle to code. AI-EP delegated CREATIVE approvals = floor, not waste.
- **Scorecard SSOT = DB row, .md = render** (not disk file) — Director chose asset-row over disk file; render-sink kept swappable.
- **fanout idempotency on the stage's OWN output** (plan), not downstream (image) — the invariant.
- **Matrix = governance modes** — a new mode is a saved preset matrix; delete the 5-mode special-casing (subtraction). Confirmed conceptually; q16 formal go pending.
- **Anti-cosmos viz** — DAG (existing pipeline) + flat matrix table + colored badges; no BPMN/state-chart notation.

